# Finance PDF Brand (locked)

Same system as `upWord/css/_reports` / albihani client reports.

## Brand
- **MAHMOUD SAEED** — blue `#4E45E4` / dark `#4237CA` / soft `#EEEDFC`
- **Never** red `#ae1e17` or the old teal monthly-report green
- Font (HTML): **IBM Plex Sans Arabic**

## Chrome
- Every page: top identity `MAHMOUD SAEED` + blue rule + doc label; page number at bottom
- Last page only: Magdy-style `.end-footer` (who + about)

## Code
- Proposal / statement HTML: `src/lib/project-document-html.ts` (`DOC_BRAND`, `wrapDocument`)
- HTML → PDF: `src/lib/project-document-pdf.ts`
- Monthly jsPDF: `src/lib/monthly-report-pdf.ts`

Any new PDF must reuse these tokens and chrome — do not invent a parallel look.
